# Documentation Voice

Write plain, direct English. Use short sentences and concrete Dex terms. State
the problem, then the mechanism. Avoid chatbot filler, marketing tone, stacked
synonyms, and prose that repeats a diagram or example.

Use inline code normally for identifiers in Markdown. Copy application snippets
from runnable examples and never invent APIs.
